cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CRC Calibrator in your research, please cite it, together with the methods it implements."
title: CRC Calibrator
abstract: >-
  Distribution-free miss guarantees for object detectors in medical imaging: conformal risk control (CRC) and
  risk-controlling prediction sets (RCPS) pick detection thresholds whose mean share of missed objects on new
  cases stays below a chosen budget.
type: software
